    <string name="pref_key_note">Translation works with no key at all. An Anthropic key is optional and used instead when set, for better quality and longer text. GIF search needs a KLIPY key. All keys are your own — there is no RimBoard server and no shared key — and are kept in private app storage, which Android encrypts until you unlock the phone. Whatever you translate is sent to the service that does it, exactly as with any online translator — unless you run your own.</string>
